      "writtenOn": "2022-06-21T11:47:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about we just remove the MakeCanvasSurface API? Clients should specify if they want the raster backend, the webgl one, or the gpu one. MakeCanvasSurface is already a little janky in that it adds an attribute to tell you if it had to fallback to CPU, which I\u0027m not a big fan of.",
