      "writtenOn": "2022-06-16T22:51:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was a bit surprised to see this too. It probably doesn\u0027t make sense for the JS objects to mirror the Skia classes 1:1, e.g. there\u0027s no benefit to exposing a separate graphite variant of this instead of just switching the backend under the hood.\n\nWe could certainly deprecate this typename. We can rename this type to GpuDirectContext/GpuBackendContext or some such that still supports the same interface functions defined below, and maintain aliases for GrDirectContext/MakeGrContext until clients have been migrated.",
      "parentUuid": "1176262f_f623d7d5",
